new
lang ru
select champagne
march
time 3
world wait contact 30
time pause
world unit royal-3
world focus
state 00-before
shot 00-start
wait 30
state 01-orders
shot 01-orders
wait 30
state 02-command
shot 02-command
wait 45
time pause
expect WorldHasArena False
expect WorldMapVisible True
expect WorldArmyCount 2
state 03-after
shot 03-after
save
remember after-native
load
same after-native
quit
